<title>USA: Kaukauna, Wis., revised NIC.</title>
<headline>Kaukauna, Wis., revised NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Corp, financial advisor for Kaukauna, Wis., said Piper Jaffray Inc's winning net interest cost for the City's general obligation bonds was 4.9944 percent, not the 4.999 percent originally provided.</p>
